<title>USA: Ste Generale hires Bear Sterns' Kelly.</title>
<headline>Ste Generale hires Bear Sterns' Kelly.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale said Wednesday John Kelly, a former managing director at Bear Stearns Cos Inc, has joined as managing director at Ste Generale and as head of its Capital Markets.</p>
<p>The position is new, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Kelly was head of Asian Fixed Income Capital Markets at Bear Stearns, the company said. At Ste Generale he will be responsible for broadening the company's capital raising activities in the United States, the company said in a release.</p>
</text>
